                "text": "Under Joe Biden and Kamala Harris, families are spending an additional $13,300 annually to buy basic goods and services.\n \n\ud83d\udcc8 Eggs are UP 69.2%\n\ud83d\udcc8 Motor vehicle insurance is UP 56.5%\n\ud83d\udcc8 Gasoline (all types) is UP 38.4%\n\ud83d\udcc8 Baby food and formula are UP 31.0%",
