                "source": "Twitter Web Client",
                "text": "California\u2019s endless regulations have driven many insurance companies out of the state, leaving residents with limited options. If Californians had access to appropriate insurance policies, the state wouldn\u2019t be so reliant on federal assistance.\n\nWhen government overreach suffocates business, the taxpayers pay the price. Governor Gavin Newsom and the state legislature are to blame. My interview with @connellmcshane on @NewsNation \u2b07\ufe0f",
