                "text": "Farmers are the backbone of West Tennessee\u2019s economy \u2014 and of our entire nation. \ud83c\udf3e\ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8\n\n@HouseGOP & @POTUS understand that, which is why the One Big Beautiful Bill makes the largest investment in agriculture in decades.\n\n\u2705 Expands crop insurance & strengthens risk management tools\n\u2705 Boosts market access by reducing trade barriers\n\u2705 Makes permanent the death tax exemption for family-owned farms\n\u2705 Supports @SecRollins\u2019 Farmers First agenda",
